flowchart TD
    START --> prepare_decision["D · prepare_decision"]
    prepare_decision --> planner["G · Planner：ExecutionPlan"]
    planner --> validate_plan["D · validate_plan"]
    validate_plan --> plan_gate{"D · 计划门禁"}
    plan_gate -->|合法| select_next_step["D · select_next_step"]
    plan_gate -->|输入缺失| clarify
    plan_gate -->|可修复且有预算| replanner
    plan_gate -->|不可继续| partial
    select_next_step --> step_gate{"D · 剩余工作"}
    step_gate -->|有 ready step| executor["D · Executor"]
    step_gate -->|无剩余| finalize_decision
    step_gate -->|依赖死锁或耗尽| partial
    executor --> operation{"D · 允许的操作"}
    operation -->|获取证据| rag["静态 Agentic RAG 子图<br/>可以原地 interrupt"]
    operation -->|两类计算| calculator["D · CalculatorPort 预留<br/>未接入返回 unavailable"]
    operation -->|评估候选| evaluate["D · evaluate_actions"]
    operation -->|组装建议| finalize_decision
    operation -->|请求玩家信息| clarify
    rag --> verify_step["D · verify_step"]
    calculator --> verify_step
    evaluate --> verify_step
    verify_step --> progress{"D · assess_progress"}
    progress -->|继续| select_next_step
    progress -->|新约束或剩余方案失效| replanner["G · Replanner<br/>保留有效成果，修订剩余步骤"]
    progress -->|需要补充| clarify
    progress -->|必要步骤通过| finalize_decision["D · finalize_decision"]
    progress -->|无依据或预算耗尽| partial
    replanner --> validate_plan
    clarify["D · clarify：interrupt<br/>持久暂停，释放 worker"] -->|同 task 的 Command resume| validate_resume["D · validate_resume"]
    validate_resume -->|有效| refresh["D · refresh_context<br/>新鲜度与版本检查，按依赖失效"]
    validate_resume -->|无效且可重问| clarify
    validate_resume -->|拒绝或耗尽| partial
    refresh --> resume_gate{"D · 恢复策略"}
    resume_gate -->|只补当前参数| select_next_step
    resume_gate -->|目标或约束变化| replanner
    finalize_decision --> final_gate{"D · 行动计划验证"}
    final_gate -->|通过| END
    final_gate -->|缺信息且有预算| clarify
    final_gate -->|可调整且有预算| replanner
    final_gate -->|不可继续| partial["D · partial：已验证部分 + 限制"]
    partial --> END

